LavaConstSC
===========

The package dev.lavaconst.soundcloud is derived from lavaplayer's SoundCloud source
(com.sedmelluq.discord.lavaplayer.source.soundcloud, https://github.com/lavalink-devs/lavaplayer),
version 2.2.6, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes from the original:
- AAC in fragmented-MP4 HLS support (SoundCloudAacSegmentDecoder), including a synthetic sidx box so lavaplayer's
  MP4 reader does not drop the first fragment.
- The HLS initialization segment (EXT-X-MAP) is prepended to every segment stream.
- Signed *.soundcloud.cloud CDN URLs no longer get a client_id appended.
- A clear error for DRM-protected tracks, and a log line listing the formats SoundCloud offered when none is playable.
- Search results and playlists skip unplayable tracks instead of failing as a whole.
- Packaged as a Lavalink plugin (dev.lavaconst.soundcloud.plugin).
